{"id": "26114", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=26114", "title": "Orleans (Massachusetts)", "text": "Orleans is in Massachusetts on Cape Cod, and includes the villages of East Orleans and South Orleans. With the Rock Harbor sunsets and the Nauset surf, Orleans has the best of both Cape Cod waters.\nGet in.\nBy car.\nHighway access is by Route 6 from the Cape Cod Canal in Bourne which is about 55 minutes away."}
